  "details": "After updating my world in VRChat, it now appears as \"World Is Not Available\" in the Favorite Worlds section. I'm not sure if this issue is affecting others or just me. I waited for a while to see if it would resolve, but since it didn't, I suspect it might be a bug. If anyone else is experiencing the same issue, please share your information.\n\nHere are the details:\n\n・The Blueprint ID remains the same, and the world is correctly recognized in the My Worlds section. This suggests that the issue is not related to the Blueprint ID.\n\n・I performed updates on November 16th JST (once for the PC version) and on the 17th (once each for Quest and PC versions). The relatively high update frequency might be a factor, but I'm not certain.\n\nMy world URL: https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_deaf5181-93cf-49b3-831b-e480c1ba0c83",
